        <title>AloeNotch</title>
        <item>
            <title>0.14.3</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:29:02 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://aloenotch.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
      <li><strong>Your keyboard and mouse stay yours.</strong> After a click
      in the notch, typing could go to the notch instead of the app in front,
      so every key beeped, and dragging a file off the shelf could leave the
      pointer stuck mid-drag. The notch now hands focus straight back, and
      never while a mouse button is held.</li>
    </ul>
]]></description>
