        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.14.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:23:32 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://aloenotch.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
      <li><strong>No more keyboard backlight readout.</strong> The light
      sensor adjusts the keyboard backlight on its own, and the notch kept
      announcing it even after 0.14.1. It's gone entirely, so the notch no
      longer watches the keyboard backlight at all. Volume, brightness and
      Caps Lock are unchanged.</li>
    </ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://aloenotch.com/assets/AloeNotch-0.14.2.dmg" length="3138008" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="BrBuEUZdv3a4aMOP4/Ko7UvcqwTvIEEGN5TmDNfYd9y0GRGqYjXG9oP781eu9WD7dldP/q1r/rgRX37uICNXAQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.14.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 23:44:28 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://aloenotch.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
      <li><strong>The keyboard backlight stays quiet.</strong> With automatic
      keyboard brightness on, the light sensor adjusts the backlight by tiny
      amounts several times a second, and 0.14.0 announced every one of them
      in the notch. Now it shows only when you change the backlight
      yourself.</li>
    </ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://aloenotch.com/assets/AloeNotch-0.14.1.dmg" length="3141282" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="GuvtfW3Xf1Ii1wHPI9j7DGVFYnaMJQFYyGs0SCLgz4Bx4XvJHKyMLNXbZ6hHs5HBrEjSnVesfTQRxKptf3L1Ag=="/>
